@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 10
left to right direction

skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #0B3B66
  BackgroundColor #F4F7FB
}

rectangle "Presentation Layer\n(Angular 19 UI & Carter Minimal APIs)" as presentation #E2F0FD {
  component "Angular 19 SPA\n(Leaflet Map, DevExtreme Grid)" as UI
  component "WebAPI Endpoints\n(Carter Route Modules)" as WebAPI
}

rectangle "Infrastructure Layer\n(Persistence & Core Services)" as infra #D1FAE5 {
  component "Entity Framework Core\n(SQL Server DbContext)" as EF
  component "Identity & Security\n(JWT Token Service)" as Security
}

rectangle "Application Layer\n(CQRS & Use Case Execution)" as app #EDE9FE {
  component "MediatR Handlers\n(Commands & Queries)" as MediatR
  component "Validation Pipeline\n(FluentValidation & MediatR Behaviors)" as Pipeline
}

rectangle "Domain Layer\n(Enterprise Business Rules)" as domain #FEE2E2 {
  component "Entities & Aggregates\n(Bus, Employe, Rattachement)" as Entities
  component "Value Objects\n(BusId, ShiftId, Coordinates)" as ValueObjects
}

UI --> WebAPI : HTTP REST / WebSockets
WebAPI --> MediatR : Dispatches Command/Query
MediatR --> Pipeline : Runs through
Pipeline --> Entities : Enforces invariants

EF -up-> MediatR : Implements Repository Interfaces
Security -up-> WebAPI : Evaluates Claims & Permissions

EF --> Entities : Persists
app --> domain : Core Dependency (Depends Inward)
infra --> app : Implements Abstractions
presentation --> app : Depends on
@enduml
